# WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRangeDebuffAggressive (22054, its shipped skills), every draw 99, 40 away
# from the character; a level 1 monster of 440 HP. The hook reads its HP before the hit's damage: a hit
# of 300 finds it whole and wants no debuff. The next finds it below a third of its HP (140): it draws
# 99 against 60 (no first debuff) and 99 twice against 50, and wants its fifth debuff, weight
# 1000000: a self shield (4029), so aimed at itself. Its parent's two draws want no physical special.
character Hunter 20
random always 99
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRange.WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRange
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRange.WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRangeAggressive
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRange.WarriorPhysicalSpecialShotRangeDebuffAggressive
npc golem 22054 Monster 40 0 0 skill PHYSICAL_SPECIAL 4032 6 skill SELF_RANGE_PHYSICAL_SPECIAL 4232 5 skill DEBUFF2 4037 1 skill DEBUFF3 4054 2 skill DEBUFF4 4028 2 skill DEBUFF5 4029 2

hit golem 300
  desires golem attack(player)=3750
hit golem 1
  desires golem attack(player)=3762.5 cast(golem,4029,move)=1000000
